<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - JDN Realty upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - JDN Realty upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it upgraded JDN Realty Corp to near-term accumulate from neutral and maintained its long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended Tuesday at 24-1/2.</p>
</text>
